# The Network: Tailscale coordination and admin
#
# Expects a proxy policy. Must precede Direct.list, whose tailscale.com suffix would otherwise swallow these.
#
# The coordination server is not reliably reachable from CN, and the admin console is ordinary browser traffic that has no reason to be direct.

DOMAIN,console.tailscale.com
DOMAIN,controlplane.tailscale.com
DOMAIN,login.tailscale.com
